{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"孟加拉","country_iso":"BGD","created_at":"2026-04-10T08:54:52.231491","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"BGD-HB-0006","ldc":"Yes","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"孟加拉500MW光伏风电项目","project_name_en":"Bangladesh 500MW Solar and Wind Power Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"","content":"上周二，\n中国机械进出口总公司CMC\n与\n孟加拉西北电力公司（NWPGCL）\n签署合资协议，\n双方成立合资公司\nBangladesh-China Power Company Ltd (Renewable)共同开发孟加拉境内500MW光伏和风电项目。合资公司的法定资本为1000亿塔卡，实收资本为16亿塔卡，NWPGCL和CMC将投资等量的资本。\n根据计划，BCPCL可再生能源公司将开发3座太阳能发电厂和1座风电厂项目，分别是\nPabna 60MW光伏、Sirajganj 100MW光伏、amuna 125MW 光伏和Payra50MW风电。\nNWPGCL是公共发电公司之一，目前拥有六个发电厂，其发电能力为1510兆瓦。CMC是中国通用技术集团下属的核心二级公司，近年来通用集团从传统的科工贸业务逐步注重投资业务，旗下中机、中技等公司开始涉足海外电力项目投资。其中，NWPGCL和CMC联合投资兴建了目前孟加拉最大的燃煤发电厂——Payra 2x660MW燃煤电厂。","content_sha256":"55073d8cf3402686e8e49fe44e782195192face4d0718daffb32f26deadcbba7","id":20870,"publish_date":"2020-07-21 12:30:24","title":"CMC签署孟加拉500MW可再生能源项目开发协议","title_sha256":"03a4245804d10ea161d5708ea05a39921ac49eadcf3d9a1756a212f84d5b8eec","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/15036.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"BGD-HB-0006","capacity_details":"Pabna 60MW PV, Sirajganj 100MW PV, amuna 125MW PV, Payra 50MW Wind","capacity_mw":285.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"285","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T08:54:52.232984","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"BGD-HB-0006-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://bd.china-embassy.gov.cn/chn/zmjw/202110/t20211019_9594483.htm\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_c